Genspark Super Agent Trigger Mechanism Research

> Complete breakdown of keywords and trigger conditions

Core question: which inputs trigger which Super Agent modality?

1. Four Trigger Decision Methods

Super Agent combines four methods in descending priority:
Trigger  Basis① Explicit keywords  Clear format words (PPT, slides, spreadsheets, draw an image…) route directly to the corresponding Agent; highest priority
② Implicit intent  Goals without format words (compare X, demonstrate Y, count Z); LLM infers the most suitable modality
③ Checkpoint question  Completely vague intent (organize this, make something); ask user with quick-choice buttons
④ Explicit shortcut  Clicking AI Slides / AI Sheets / AI Docs in dashboard sidebar bypasses routing and enters the modality

